 "raw_html": "<body><div class=\"eltdf-grid eltdf-ls-content-area\">\n<div class=\"rehabIntro\">\n<div class=\"rehabContent\">\n<div class=\"excerptData\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content-inner\">\n<h3><strong>About</strong> Emergo Recovery</h3>\n<p>Emergo Recovery offers inpatient treatment for individuals with alcohol and/or substance addiction. The program includes individual counselling, group therapy, recreational therapy and more. Emergo Recovery is located at Barrie, Ontario.</p>\n<div class=\"specialAmenities\">\n<div class=\"specialties\">\n<h4></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"allamenities\">\n<h4>Amenities</h4>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<p>Resort Setting</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Private Setting</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Residential Setting</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Lakeside</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Acupuncture</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Art Activities</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Business Center</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Gym</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Outdoor Activities</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Massage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Meditation</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Music Therapy</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Recreation Room</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Private Transportation</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Yoga Studio</div>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"subtitle\">Admissions</h4>\n<div class=\"row section-content\">\n<div class=\"data-container title-only\">\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Programs for Women</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Programs for Men</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Adult Programs</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\">\n<div class=\"text\">Young Adult Programs</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4>Therapies</h4>\n<p>Holistic Therapy</p>\n<p>Evidence-Based Practices</p>\n<p>Yoga &amp; Meditation</p>\n<p>Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling</p>\n<p>Family Therapy &amp; Counseling</p>\n<p>Group Therapy &amp; Counseling</p>\n<p>Nutritional Counseling</p>\n<p>Art &amp; Nature Therapy</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"rehabContacts\">\n<div class=\"rehabContactsSidebar\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-contact-info\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-cid-holder\">\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mobile\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:(249) 877-8776\" itemprop=\"url\">(249) 877-8776</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mail\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email-link\" href=\"mailto:info@emergorecovery.com\" itemprop=\"url\">info@emergorecovery.com</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_globe-2\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url-link\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://emergorecovery.com/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://emergorecovery.com/</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-address\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_house\"></span>\t                    92 Caplan Ave #603, Barrie, ON L4N 0Z7, Canada\t                </p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"eltdf-btn eltdf-btn-huge eltdf-btn-solid eltdf-btn-icon eltdf-enquiry-opener\" type=\"submit\"> <span class=\"eltdf-btn-text\">Contact Business</span> <i class=\"eltdf-icon-ion-icon icon ion-android-person\"></i> </button>\n</div>\n</div> <div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads\">\n<h4 class=\"eltdf-ls-parts-title\">Sponsored Ad</h4>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-info\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\"><img alt=\"addiction rehab centres\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\" src=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg 970w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-300x285.jpg 300w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-768x728.jpg 768w\" width=\"970\"/></a> <h2 class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-title\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\">Start Your Journey Now</a> </h2>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-text\">Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada.\nOur list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered.\n\nFor immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></body>"
